   "bounds": [
    "The count of killed TS mutants is 262 of 270. None of the eight is a kill, in any summary.",
    "archive.L140.4 keeps an open obligation: an end-to-end vector through cook.main or the deployment boundary, where the missing check changes the public code."
   ],
   "evidence": [
